        <desc id="architecture-delta-dark-desc">A durable order queue replaces the legacy dispatcher, Orders API changes from v1 to v2, the fulfilment worker moves without changing implementation, and the storefront and database stay unchanged, with seven component and relationship changes listed between both snapshots.</desc>
